{"seq":3,"slug":"type-design-systems","title":"字体设计系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-typography-fonts/practice/type-design-systems","wordCount":1194,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"字体设计系统\">字体设计系统</h1><p>一个页面里手写几个 <code>font-size: 14px</code> 没问题，但当产品涨到一百个页面、五个团队各写各的，散落各处的字号、行高、字重就会迅速失控——同一级标题在不同页面是 <code>28px</code> 和 <code>30px</code>，正文一会儿 <code>15px</code> 一会儿 <code>16px</code>，整个产品看起来像拼凑的。字体设计系统就是把排版从「逐页手调」升级为「系统化生产」：用一套有数学关系的字号阶梯、一组可被代码消费的 design token、一套流式缩放规则，让全团队复用同一套排版语言。这是本 hub 的终点，它把前面所有篇的零件收进一个可维护的体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>字体设计系统有三层：底层是有比例关系的字号阶梯（type scale），中层是把字号/行高/字重/字距打包成的语义 token，顶层是组件与页面对这些 token 的消费。下图自底向上展示这条沉淀链。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[模块化比例 modular scale] --&gt; B[type scale 字号阶梯]&#10;  B --&gt; C[语义 token: 行高/字重/字距打包]&#10;  C --&gt; D[flowing: clamp 流式缩放]&#10;  D --&gt; E[组件消费 token]&#10;  E --&gt; F[全产品排版一致]&#10;  C --&gt; G[导出多平台: CSS 变量/JSON/原生]\">flowchart TD\n  A[模块化比例 modular scale] --&gt; B[type scale 字号阶梯]\n  B --&gt; C[语义 token: 行高/字重/字距打包]\n  C --&gt; D[flowing: clamp 流式缩放]\n  D --&gt; E[组件消费 token]\n  E --&gt; F[全产品排版一致]\n  C --&gt; G[导出多平台: CSS 变量/JSON/原生]</pre><p>关键转变是从「写具体数值」到「引用语义名」——组件写的不是 <code>font-size: 1.25rem</code>，而是 <code>font: var(--text-lg)</code>，于是改一处比例，全站随动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模块化比例与字号阶梯\">模块化比例与字号阶梯</h2><p>字号阶梯不该是随手挑的数，而该由一个比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 从基准字号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 逐级生成：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 级字号为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_n = b \\cdot r^{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。常用比率取自传统排版与音乐音程，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span>（小三度）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span></span></span></span></span>（大三度）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.333</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.333</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.333</span></span></span></span></span>（完全四度）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.618</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.618</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.618</span></span></span></span></span>（黄金比）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比率</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1.125</td>\n<td>大二度</td>\n<td>级差小，层级细</td>\n<td>信息密集型界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>小三度</td>\n<td>温和</td>\n<td>通用 Web 应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.25</td>\n<td>大三度</td>\n<td>对比清晰</td>\n<td>内容站、营销页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.333</td>\n<td>完全四度</td>\n<td>对比强</td>\n<td>标题主导的页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.618</td>\n<td>黄金比</td>\n<td>对比极强</td>\n<td>大字排版、海报式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\":root {&#10;  --ratio: 1.25;&#10;  --text-base: 1rem;&#10;  --text-sm: calc(var(--text-base) / var(--ratio));&#10;  --text-lg: calc(var(--text-base) * var(--ratio));&#10;  --text-xl: calc(var(--text-lg) * var(--ratio));&#10;  --text-2xl: calc(var(--text-xl) * var(--ratio));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --ratio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --text-base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --text-sm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">calc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--text-base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--ratio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --text-lg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">calc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--text-base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--ratio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --text-xl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">calc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--text-lg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--ratio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --text-2xl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">calc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--text-xl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--ratio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>比率越大，相邻级差越显眼，层级感越强但可用级数变少；信息密集型后台宜取小比率，标题主导的营销页可取大比率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把排版打包成-token\">把排版打包成 token</h2><p>字号只是排版的一个维度。一个成熟的 token 还应把行高、字重、字距、甚至 <code>text-wrap</code> 默认值一起打包成语义角色（如 <code>display</code>/<code>heading</code>/<code>body</code>/<code>caption</code>），用 CSS 简写 <code>font</code> 或自定义属性组消费：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\":root {&#10;  --font-body: 400 1rem/1.6 var(--font-sans); /* 字重/字号/行高/字族 */&#10;  --font-h1: 700 var(--text-2xl)/1.15 var(--font-sans);&#10;  --font-caption: 400 var(--text-sm)/1.4 var(--font-sans);&#10;}&#10;h1 {&#10;  font: var(--font-h1);&#10;  text-wrap: balance;&#10;}&#10;p {&#10;  font: var(--font-body);&#10;  text-wrap: pretty;&#10;}&#10;small {&#10;  font: var(--font-caption);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --font-body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.6</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--font-sans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 字重/字号/行高/字族 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --font-h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">700</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--text-2xl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.15</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--font-sans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --font-caption</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--text-sm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--font-sans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--font-h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  text-wrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--font-body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  text-wrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: pretty;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">small</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--font-caption</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里行高沿用<a href=\"../layout/vertical-rhythm\">垂直节奏与行高</a>的无单位系数、<code>text-wrap</code> 沿用<a href=\"../layout/line-breaking-wrapping\">断行与换行控制</a>的取值、字族沿用<a href=\"../foundations/web-safe-system-fonts\">系统字体与回退</a>的系统栈——设计系统不是新知识，而是把全 hub 的决策固化成一处可改的 token。可访问性约束（对比度、<code>rem</code> 字号）也应作为 token 的硬约束写进系统，见<a href=\"typography-accessibility\">排版可访问性</a>。</p>\n<p>token 还应能导出到多平台：用 Style Dictionary 之类工具把同一份 token 源编译成 Web 的 CSS 变量、iOS/Android 原生常量、设计工具的样式，保证设计与代码同源。设计 token 的通用机制（命名、分层、别名）属于 CSS 架构范畴，见跨库链接，本篇只讲排版这一类 token。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流式排版-让阶梯随视口缩放\">流式排版：让阶梯随视口缩放</h2><p>固定字号阶梯在桌面和手机上同一套显得僵硬——桌面够大的标题搬到手机会过大。流式排版用 <code>clamp()</code> 让每级字号在一个区间内随视口平滑缩放，免去多套断点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\":root {&#10;  /* 最小 1.5rem, 随视口增长, 最大 3rem */&#10;  --text-2xl: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1.5vw, 3rem);&#10;  --text-xl: clamp(1.25rem, 1.1rem + 0.8vw, 2rem);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 最小 1.5rem, 随视口增长, 最大 3rem */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --text-2xl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">vw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --text-xl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.25</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">vw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>clamp(min, preferred, max)</code> 的 <code>preferred</code> 项务必混入 <code>rem</code>（不能纯 <code>vw</code>），否则破坏用户缩放能力——这条红线在<a href=\"typography-accessibility\">排版可访问性</a>讲过。可用 Utopia 这类工具按两个视口断点的字号自动算出整套流式阶梯的 <code>clamp()</code> 公式，省去手算。</p>\n<p>至此，一套设计系统把字号比例、语义 token、流式缩放、可访问性约束、跨平台导出收进一处。新页面不再各写各的，而是消费同一套排版语言——这正是从「一款字体」走到「一套排版系统」的最后一跃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>字体设计系统分三层：模块化比例生成的字号阶梯 → 打包行高/字重/字距的语义 token → 组件消费，改一处比例全站随动。</li>\n<li>字号阶梯由比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 从基准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_n = b \\cdot r^{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；密集界面取小比率（1.125–1.2），标题主导取大比率（1.333–1.618）。</li>\n<li>token 把字号、行高（无单位）、字重、字距、<code>text-wrap</code>、字族打包成语义角色，用 <code>font</code> 简写消费，是全 hub 决策的固化。</li>\n<li>token 应能用 Style Dictionary 等导出到 Web/原生/设计工具，保证设计与代码同源。</li>\n<li>流式排版用 <code>clamp()</code> 让各级字号随视口平滑缩放、免多套断点；<code>preferred</code> 项必须混 <code>rem</code> 以保用户缩放，可用 Utopia 自动生成。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../layout/vertical-rhythm\">垂直节奏与行高</a> —— token 中的无单位行高来源。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"typography-accessibility\">排版可访问性</a> —— 流式 <code>clamp()</code> 的 <code>rem</code> 红线与对比度约束。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/web-safe-system-fonts\">系统字体与回退</a> —— token 中字族栈的来源。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../modern-css-architecture/architecture/design-tokens-variables\">设计 token 与 CSS 变量</a> —— token 命名、分层、别名的通用机制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"字体设计系统","id":"字体设计系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模块化比例与字号阶梯","id":"模块化比例与字号阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"把排版打包成 token","id":"把排版打包成-token"},{"level":2,"text":"流式排版：让阶梯随视口缩放","id":"流式排版-让阶梯随视口缩放"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"排版可访问性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-typography-fonts/practice/typography-accessibility"},"next":null}